      "title": "GAPS: Global-Aware Prediction-driven Scheduling for Large-Scale LLM Inference",
      "reason": "The official IFAAMAS AAMAS 2026 paper presents a global-aware LLM cluster scheduler combining online monitoring, bias-corrected prediction, request assignment, and selective migration. Its discrete-event simulation on code and conversational workloads reports reduced P99 latency and SLO violations, directly addressing large-scale LLM inference serving; the evidence is simulation-based, not production deployment.",
